Package: cursus
Version: __VERSION__
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: __ARCH__
Maintainer: cursus maintainers <noreply@example.com>
Description: cursus - Talaria-based VPN server and client (single binary)
 cursus is one statically linked binary that runs either as a VPN server or
 as a VPN client, selected with `-role server|client` and a YAML config.
 .
 Protocol: TalariaUDP (UDP/443) or TalariaTCP (TCP/443), TLS 1.3 with a
 publicly trusted certificate. Based on the AGPL-3.0-only Talaria library.
Homepage: https://github.com/LeisureLinux/cursus
